eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"jziRKhtHxeJPAPWS21jRYw","review_id":"XklQa9M1G2tWCLUqdTsVZQ","date":"2011-11-13T16:42:46","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.924103856086731,"text_excerpt":"Food was excellent as was the service. They had run out of the huge chocolate cake which was kind of disappointing for my friend, as she doesn't like cheesecake. Went here my last night in Nola and was pleased with the food overall."},{"business_id":"jziRKhtHxeJPAPWS21jRYw","review_id":"7FfiCUmsdVKFQgxADy3KPA","date":"2014-08-14T14:09:18","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9195953607559204,"text_excerpt":"My husband and I went here for dinner our first night in NOLA. It was walking distance from our hotel and was recommended by the front desk staff. We had a coupon for a free appetizer so we got the crab and crawfish bake. It was delicious. We then had fantastic caeser salad. I ordered the crab filled ravioli. It was ok. My husband ordered the crawfish ravioli and it was DELICIOUS! I kept taking bits off his plate. We ordered dessert to go.....the fudge brownie a la mode and peanut butter cheesecake. Both were a delicious late night snack. All in all, we plan on making it back here again before vacation is over. Our server, Jason, was very accommodating and great."},{"business_id":"jziRKhtHxeJPAPWS21jRYw","review_id":"M7mr8fdwgPyJeP-bJRtDug","date":"2014-05-01T00:54:31","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.915095329284668,"text_excerpt":"I am excited Cheesecake Bistro is still around. It's a classic local business;,but I have to digress and say I love Cheesecake Factory!! Excited they are coming to NOLA. The food has gotten so so at this restaurant. The crab bake is not the same. PLEASE work on that. At one time it was the bomb.com. The lunch salad portion was pretty generous. There was no wait for us during lunch. That was a pleasantry. Lunch special gives you an entree and dessert. Ow!! Thanks CB!!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"jziRKhtHxeJPAPWS21jRYw","photo_id":"TiI_9u0deMT8Y0RWNlaD8w","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/TiI_9u0deMT8Y0RWNlaD8w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9200847744941711},{"business_id":"jziRKhtHxeJPAPWS21jRYw","photo_id":"vnerWJ1sBrUqsu_Nvmfxhg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/vnerWJ1sBrUqsu_Nvmfxhg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9200847744941711}]},"notebook_case":null}
